  FT["PH-H2477"] = {"id":"PH-H2477","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2750_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"规定在北三宝颜省Sindañgan市镇设立急诊医院，名称为北三宝颜急诊医院，并授权为此拨款的法案","en":"An Act Providing for the Establishment of an Emergency Hospital in the Municipality of Sindañgan, Province of Zamboanga del Norte, to be Known as the Zamboanga del Norte Emergency Hospital, and Authorizing the Appropriation of Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Providing for the Establishment of an Emergency Hospital in the Municipality of Sindañgan, Province of Zamboanga del Norte, to be Known as the Zamboanga del Norte Emergency Hospital, and Authorizing the Appropriation of Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập Bệnh viện Cấp cứu tại Thị trấn Sindañgan, Tỉnh Zamboanga del Norte với tên gọi Bệnh viện Cấp cứu Zamboanga del Norte, và phân bổ kinh phí cho mục đích này","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งโรงพยาบาลฉุกเฉินในเทศบาล Sindañgan จังหวัด Zamboanga del Norte ในชื่อโรงพยาบาลฉุกเฉิน Zamboanga del Norte และจัดสรรเงินทุนสำหรับการนี้","id":"Undang-Undang membentuk Rumah Sakit Gawat Darurat di Kotamadya Sindañgan, Provinsi Zamboanga del Norte dengan nama Rumah Sakit Gawat Darurat Zamboanga del Norte, dan mengalokasikan dana untuk itu","ms":"Akta menubuhkan Hospital Kecemasan di Perbandaran Sindañgan, Wilayah Zamboanga del Norte dengan nama Hospital Kecemasan Zamboanga del Norte, dan memperuntukkan dana untuk itu"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["health"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2750","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 3 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2750_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2477-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"There is hereby established, under the supervision of the Director of Medical Services, an emergency hospital in the Municipality of Sindañgan, Province of Zamboanga del Norte, to be known as the Zamboanga del Norte Emergency Hospital. The site shall be determined by the Municipal Council of the Municipality of Sindañgan, Province of Zamboanga del Norte, in consultation with the Director of Medical Services."}},{"id":"PH-H2477-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"The sum of one hundred fifty thousand pesos is hereby authorized to be appropriated, out of any funds in the National Treasury not otherwise appropriated, for the establishment, operation and maintenance of said hospital."}},{"id":"PH-H2477-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p35","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Providing for the Establishment of an Emergency Hospital in the Municipality of Sindañgan, Province of Zamboanga del Norte, to be Known as the Zamboanga del Norte Emergency Hospital, and Authorizing the Appropriation of Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
