  FT["PH-H2508"] = {"id":"PH-H2508","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2781_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"修订第1613号共和国法第4条A-Buildings编第c款第209页第（41）项的法案","en":"An Act to Amend Item (41), Page 209, Paragraph c, Title A-Buildings, Section Four of Republic Act Numbered Sixteen Hundred Thirteen","orig":"An Act to Amend Item (41), Page 209, Paragraph c, Title A-Buildings, Section Four of Republic Act Numbered Sixteen Hundred Thirteen","vi":"Đạo luật sửa đổi Điều 4 của Đạo luật Cộng hòa số 1613","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแก้ไขเพิ่มเติมมาตรา 4 แห่งพระราชบัญญัติแห่งสาธารณรัฐที่ 1613","id":"Undang-Undang mengubah Pasal 4 Undang-Undang Republik No. 1613","ms":"Akta meminda Seksyen 4 Akta Republik No. 1613"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2781","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2781_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2508-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Item (41), page 209, paragraph c, Title A—Buildings, Section four of Republic Act Numbered Sixteen hundred thirteen is amended to read as follows:\n\"(41) New Tanauan Municipal Building, Tanauan, Batangas—Construction and/or improvement ₱100,000.00\""}},{"id":"PH-H2508-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p35","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act to Amend Item (41), Page 209, Paragraph c, Title A-Buildings, Section Four of Republic Act Numbered Sixteen Hundred Thirteen","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H2509"] = {"id":"PH-H2509","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2782_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"修订第2093号共和国法第1条第a款B编第16页八打雁省第（v）项的法案","en":"An Act to Amend Item (v), for the Province of Batangas, Page 16, Title B, Paragraph a, Section One of Republic Act Numbered Twenty Hundred and Ninety-Three","orig":"An Act to Amend Item (v), for the Province of Batangas, Page 16, Title B, Paragraph a, Section One of Republic Act Numbered Twenty Hundred and Ninety-Three","vi":"Đạo luật sửa đổi Điều 1 của Đạo luật Cộng hòa số 2093","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแก้ไขเพิ่มเติมมาตรา 1 แห่งพระราชบัญญัติแห่งสาธารณรัฐที่ 2093","id":"Undang-Undang mengubah Pasal 1 Undang-Undang Republik No. 2093","ms":"Akta meminda Seksyen 1 Akta Republik No. 2093"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2782","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2782_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2509-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Item (v), for the Province of Batangas, page 16, Title B, paragraph a, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Twenty hundred and ninety-three is amended to read as follows:\n\"(v) Darasa feeder road, Tanauan—Construction ₱10,000.00.\""}},{"id":"PH-H2509-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p35","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act to Amend Item (v), for the Province of Batangas, Page 16, Title B, Paragraph a, Section One of Republic Act Numbered Twenty Hundred and Ninety-Three","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H2510"] = {"id":"PH-H2510","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2783_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将卡加延省拉萨姆市镇图卡兰-米尼安加村的名称变更为Nicolas Agatep村的法案","en":"An Act Changing the Name of the Barrio of Tucalan-Miñañga in the Municipality of Lasam, Province of Cagayan, to Nicolas Agatep","orig":"An Act Changing the Name of the Barrio of Tucalan-Miñañga in the Municipality of Lasam, Province of Cagayan, to Nicolas Agatep","vi":"Đạo luật đổi tên Barrio Tucalan-Miñañga tại Thị trấn Lasam, Tỉnh Cagayan thành Nicolas Agatep","th":"พระราชบัญญัติเปลี่ยนชื่อบารริโอ Tucalan-Miñañga ในเทศบาล Lasam, จังหวัด Cagayan เป็น Nicolas Agatep","id":"Undang-Undang mengubah nama Barrio Tucalan-Miñañga di Kotamadya Lasam, Provinsi Cagayan menjadi Nicolas Agatep","ms":"Akta menukar nama Barrio Tucalan-Miñañga di Perbandaran Lasam, Wilayah Cagayan menjadi Nicolas Agatep"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2783","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2783_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2510-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The name of the barrio of Tucalan-Miñañga in the Municipality of Lasam, Province of Cagayan, is changed to Nicolas Agatep."}},{"id":"PH-H2510-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p35","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Changing the Name of the Barrio of Tucalan-Miñañga in the Municipality of Lasam, Province of Cagayan, to Nicolas Agatep","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H2511"] = {"id":"PH-H2511","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2784_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"在奎松省Mauban市镇设立急诊医院并为此授权拨款七万比索的法案","en":"An Act to Establish an Emergency Hospital in the Municipality of Mauban, Province of Quezon, and to Authorize the Appropriation of Seventy Thousand Pesos for the Purpose","orig":"An Act to Establish an Emergency Hospital in the Municipality of Mauban, Province of Quezon, and to Authorize the Appropriation of Seventy Thousand Pesos for the Purpose","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập Bệnh viện Cấp cứu tại Thị trấn Mauban, Tỉnh Quezon, và phân bổ kinh phí cho mục đích này","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งโรงพยาบาลฉุกเฉินในเทศบาล Mauban จังหวัด Quezon และจัดสรรเงินทุนสำหรับการนี้","id":"Undang-Undang membentuk Rumah Sakit Gawat Darurat di Kotamadya Mauban, Provinsi Quezon, dan mengalokasikan dana untuk itu","ms":"Akta menubuhkan Hospital Kecemasan di Perbandaran Mauban, Wilayah Quezon, dan memperuntukkan dana untuk itu"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["health"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2784","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 4 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2784_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2511-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"There shall be established, under the direct supervision of the Director of Medical Services, an emergency hospital in the Municipality of Mauban, Province of Quezon. The site for the said hospital shall be in a public land in said municipality, which is hereby set aside for this purpose, to be determined by the said Director of Medical Services in consultation with the Director of the Bureau of Lands."}},{"id":"PH-H2511-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Upon recommendation of the Director of Medical Services, the President shall set aside and reserve such portion of the public land located in the Municipality of Mauban, Province of Quezon, as may be necessary and convenient for the establishment of the hospital."}},{"id":"PH-H2511-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"The sum of seventy thousand pesos is hereby authorized to be appropriated, out of any funds in the National Treasury not otherwise appropriated, for the establishment, operation and maintenance of the said hospital for the fiscal year ending June thirty, nineteen hundred and sixty-one. Such sum as may be necessary for its operation and maintenance in subsequent years shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H2511-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p35","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act to Establish an Emergency Hospital in the Municipality of Mauban, Province of Quezon, and to Authorize the Appropriation of Seventy Thousand Pesos for the Purpose","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H2512"] = {"id":"PH-H2512","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2785_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Sagnay市","en":"An Act Declaring the Sitios of Ocini, Octawan and Maylocban in the Municipality of Sagnay, Province of Camarines Sur, as Part of the Barrio of Tinorognan","orig":"An Act Declaring the Sitios of Ocini, Octawan and Maylocban in the Municipality of Sagnay, Province of Camarines Sur, as Part of the Barrio of Tinorognan"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2785","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2785_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2512-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The sitios of Ocini, Octawan and Maylocban in the Municipality of Sagnay, Province of Camarines Sur, are declared as part of the barrio of Tinorognan."}},{"id":"PH-H2512-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p35"};
  FT["PH-H2513"] = {"id":"PH-H2513","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2786_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":11,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立北苏里高与南苏里高省的法案","en":"An Act to Create the Provinces of Surigao del Norte and Surigao del Sur","orig":"An Act to Create the Provinces of Surigao del Norte and Surigao del Sur"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2786","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 11 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2786_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2513-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The province of Surigao is hereby divided into two provinces, one to be known as Surigao del Norte and the other as Surigao del Sur."}},{"id":"PH-H2513-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"The Province of Surigao del Norte shall consist of that portion of the present Province of Surigao which comprises the municipalities of Dinagat, Loreto, Dapa, Numancia, General Luna, Pilar, Sapao, Malimono, Anaoaon, Surigao, Placer, Tagana-an, Mainit, Tubod, Bacuag, Gigaquit, Claver, Sison, San Isidro, Albor and Cagdianao."}},{"id":"PH-H2513-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"The Province of Surigao del Sur shall consist of the other portion of the present Province of Surigao comprising the municipalities of Carrascal, Cantilan, Madrid, Lanuza, Cortez, Tandag, Tago, Cagwait, Hinatuan, Marihatag, Lianga, Bislig and Lingig."}},{"id":"PH-H2513-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"The capital of Surigao del Norte shall be Surigao and that of Surigao del Sur shall be Tandag."}},{"id":"PH-H2513-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Except as hereinafter provided, all provisions of law now or hereafter applicable to regular provinces shall be applicable to the provinces of Surigao del Norte and Surigao del Sur."}},{"id":"PH-H2513-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6."},"text":{"en":"The present elective provincial officers of Surigao shall, until their successors shall have been elected and shall have qualified, perform their respective duties as such officers in either of the two provinces herein created which they shall individually choose within thirty days from the date of the approval of this Act: Provided, That they shall continue to receive the salaries they are receiving at the time of the approval of this Act until the new readjustment of salaries in accordance with existing law. Such elective officers as may be necessary to fill vacancies in either of the said provinces shall for the time being be appointed by the President of the Philippines with the consent of the Commission on Appointments and shall hold office until December thirty-one, nineteen hundred sixty-one and/or until their successors shall have been elected and shall have qualified."}},{"id":"PH-H2513-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7."},"text":{"en":"Special elections shall be held in either or both provinces to fill elective provincial positions which shall be vacated by incumbent provincial elective officials, said special elections to be held simultaneously with the national elections in November, nineteen hundred sixty-one. The Commission on Elections is directed to carry into effect the provisions of this section. Nothing herein contained shall affect the term of office of the incumbent elected provincial officials of Surigao."}},{"id":"PH-H2513-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8."},"text":{"en":"The present appointive provincial officers and employees of Surigao shall likewise perform their respective duties as such in either of the two provinces herein created which they shall individually choose within thirty days from the date of the approval hereof: Provided, That they shall continue to receive the salaries they are receiving at the time of the approval of this Act until the new readjustment of salaries in accordance with existing law. Such appointive officers and employees as may be necessary to organize, or to complete, the government personnel of either province shall be appointed as provided by law."}},{"id":"PH-H2513-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9."},"text":{"en":"The provinces of Surigao del Norte and Surigao del Sur shall each have one Representative: Provided, That the present Representative of the Province of Surigao shall, during his term of office as such, be the Representative for the Province of Surigao del Norte: Provided, further, That he shall likewise be the Representative for the Province of Surigao del Sur until a Representative for the latter province shall have been elected in the next general election for national officials or in a special election called for the purpose."}},{"id":"PH-H2513-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10."},"text":{"en":"Upon effectivity of this Act, the obligations, funds, assets and other properties of the present Province of Surigao shall be divided equitably between the provinces of Surigao del Norte and Surigao del Sur by the President of the Philippines upon the recommendation of the Auditor General."}},{"id":"PH-H2513-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p35","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act to Create the Provinces of Surigao del Norte and Surigao del Sur","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
